            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nPlease, provide a reproducible setup (Neovim config, file/project description, and exact key presses) for me to reproduce this.\n\nJudging by the error `attempt to index local 'details' (a userdata value)`, the `labelDetails` value is not a plain table (as it is expected and should be), but a `userdata`. This hints that there is some interference outside of 'mini.completion' itself. So based on this, I am going to close the issue until there is clean reproduction steps.",
